OL,3,AElon Musk's millions fail to deliver
OL,4,ATexas for the Republicans in fierce
OL,5,Amidterms
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe money was not enough to stop the
OL,8,Fseat from turning Democrat for the
OL,9,Ffirst time since 1988. In his
OL,10,Facceptance speech, Talarico said: "We
OL,11,Fjust proved that all the money in the
OL,12,Fworld is no match for the people of
OL,13,FTexas."
OL,15,F"Guess my election-interfering space
OL,16,Flasers didn't work this time," Musk
OL,17,Fjokingly wrote on X.
